[{:db/id "q-74401/selection/7d2db96cdd6476290a89fa3a9bb559c8795c92cd1f6c5d9b992b70e339d1dc28" :answer/id #uuid "07446333-1623-55f8-a742-6bb3c545119c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡6x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74401/selection/caa997efe5ea6b9c9c299c03e53253cfc1abaaf26f2e7abeb4dbdfd02ea1aa67" :answer/id #uuid "662253e5-1777-5a1c-aaca-6c31aadb4e51" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4x+\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{cos}⁡6x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74401/selection/6d5bb8177c934581c10045f205b22e8519166bdc47bbaffe9a88ef32b5ea633f" :answer/id #uuid "915aa4ae-f2aa-5053-91da-4d5b348f5358" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4x-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡6x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74401/selection/8d88842f78bfd43412939e1c125c75f9cfcc30acbfa0d8e2d3cfbe2e58de2d0a" :answer/id #uuid "0b3e7044-1f7d-5ba9-9fe1-a38790796c9a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4-\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{cos}⁡6x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74401/selection/402958f0c3c65e7a2bdb6c52017b172dca9d03cd012540b3de5185d586e1511a" :answer/id #uuid "4f7b1061-7a93-5669-9c0f-60e1020cfade" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4x+\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡6x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74401/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "7b1f21f3-f435-5ad3-8ba7-2050c5894e10" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-74401/selection/caa997efe5ea6b9c9c299c03e53253cfc1abaaf26f2e7abeb4dbdfd02ea1aa67" :answer-field/choices ["q-74401/selection/7d2db96cdd6476290a89fa3a9bb559c8795c92cd1f6c5d9b992b70e339d1dc28" "q-74401/selection/caa997efe5ea6b9c9c299c03e53253cfc1abaaf26f2e7abeb4dbdfd02ea1aa67" "q-74401/selection/6d5bb8177c934581c10045f205b22e8519166bdc47bbaffe9a88ef32b5ea633f" "q-74401/selection/8d88842f78bfd43412939e1c125c75f9cfcc30acbfa0d8e2d3cfbe2e58de2d0a" "q-74401/selection/402958f0c3c65e7a2bdb6c52017b172dca9d03cd012540b3de5185d586e1511a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-74401" :question/id #uuid "f4ecf345-3248-5556-b2f2-2b7202138cfb" :question/math-academy-id "q-74401" :question/problem "$\\int (4-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡3x\\operatorname{cos}⁡3x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "In this case, we use the double-angle formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡2\\theta =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\,⇒\\,\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\theta )=\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta .\n$$\n\n \n\nLetting $\\theta =3x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡6x & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡3x\\operatorname{cos}⁡3x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (4-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡3x\\operatorname{cos}⁡3x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (4-3\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡6x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4x-\\frac{3}{2}(-\\frac{1}{6}\\operatorname{cos}⁡6x)+C \\\\  & =4x+\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{cos}⁡6x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-74401/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c4c5541e-8195-53de-b604-e622c3b6a2e7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-74401"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-348715"] :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040629/assets/41304b7f8cbaf3df778e0f079a1651d2846f94dc74012db3b2ce936144eac8c7.png)\n\nFind the area $A$ of the region in the $xy$-plane that is bounded by the curve $y=4\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{x}{2}),$ the $x$-axis and the lines $x=\\frac{\\pi }{6}$ and $x=\\frac{5\\pi }{6},$ as shown above. Do not round the answer.\n\n$A=$\n{{field-1}}" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-114677/selection/5aff622cabe0ffa1fb60ecadcbe3658b3c1e48716d327e337c5f8c801ee54eaa" :answer/id #uuid "ac2b56b2-ccad-5fdb-aabb-5b793ad9876d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114677/selection/963dbbf4286b7f6d5990faeb2cf0b034a320b60136a33ecf57d89ef93354e786" :answer/id #uuid "eed7b905-9473-586f-98d4-3affc767e218" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114677/selection/2a1264a3ff8d137c752ea8bd1b7d0d5c6136662b9dbe75d238fc1c0fbf276103" :answer/id #uuid "fcfc0fe7-b049-5e5c-a53b-a59ca96f87f7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114677/selection/62f4230672c6f30608baaf2a50dc2e1f27fca827964d7528b8099aca4920a1e9" :answer/id #uuid "66f3655c-8a66-5167-889e-e00142c53e26" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114677/selection/efa8d1063859fb5bd6680ec660b5d7838c2386b35570761dfb4b14b15a019e22" :answer/id #uuid "f40b31fb-8e5f-5415-b935-ae2cb4f42e00" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114677/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "fe5ffd91-0b39-50fc-acdc-6bc6d557bb50" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-114677/selection/5aff622cabe0ffa1fb60ecadcbe3658b3c1e48716d327e337c5f8c801ee54eaa" :answer-field/choices ["q-114677/selection/5aff622cabe0ffa1fb60ecadcbe3658b3c1e48716d327e337c5f8c801ee54eaa" "q-114677/selection/963dbbf4286b7f6d5990faeb2cf0b034a320b60136a33ecf57d89ef93354e786" "q-114677/selection/2a1264a3ff8d137c752ea8bd1b7d0d5c6136662b9dbe75d238fc1c0fbf276103" "q-114677/selection/62f4230672c6f30608baaf2a50dc2e1f27fca827964d7528b8099aca4920a1e9" "q-114677/selection/efa8d1063859fb5bd6680ec660b5d7838c2386b35570761dfb4b14b15a019e22"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-114677" :question/id #uuid "3ab694ca-3522-5886-8748-89bccc4c5cb5" :question/math-academy-id "q-114677" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{x}{4})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{x}{4})\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "In this case, we use the double-angle formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡2\\theta =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\,⇒\\,\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2\\theta =\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta .\n$$\n\n \n\nLetting $\\theta =\\frac{x}{4},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{x}{2}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{x}{4})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{x}{4}).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{x}{4})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{x}{4})\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}[-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})]+C \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-114677/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c4c5541e-8195-53de-b604-e622c3b6a2e7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-114677"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-348705/field-1/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "d8d6c8a7-d0d6-5252-8063-4cdeae52ff73" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-348705/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "921109d2-472c-5ad6-83e6-9ed2084f48fb" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-348705/field-1/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer-field/choices ["q-348705/field-1/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-348705" :question/id #uuid "a1ec3a42-2a31-535c-b647-69694b17ef74" :question/math-academy-id "q-348705" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040629/assets/ae150f223d210225b6490bebb859909b07842a8b7abb41137cf0206312aead2e.png)\n\nFind the area $A$ of the region in the $xy$-plane that is bounded by the curve $y=5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{x}{4})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{x}{4}),$ the $x$-axis and the lines $x=0$ and $x=\\pi ,$ as shown above. Do not round the answer.\n\n$A=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "The area of the region is given by\n\n$$\nA={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{x}{4})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{x}{4})\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nIn this case, we use the double-angle formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡2\\theta =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \n$$\n\nLetting $\\theta =\\frac{x}{4},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{x}{2}) & =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{x}{4})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{x}{4}).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{x}{4})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{x}{4})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }\\frac{5}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-5\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})\\,{|}_{0}^{\\pi } \\\\  & =-5\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})+5\\operatorname{cos}⁡0 \\\\  & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-348705/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c4c5541e-8195-53de-b604-e622c3b6a2e7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-348705"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-114685/selection/8ff